Grain Elevator 0.1.0

Audio decoding, CLAP DSP, FFT, and resampling were adapted from the owner's
COVE.EMBED implementation. Model weights are obtained from the selected pinned
Hugging Face repository and retain their upstream licensing/attribution.

Gemma preprocessing implements the pinned Hugging Face Transformers 5.19.0
Gemma4AudioFeatureExtractor behavior (Apache-2.0, Hugging Face contributors).
CLAP: LAION CLAP HTSAT Unfused. Gemma: Google EmbeddingGemma 2.
Symphonia is MPL-2.0 and is used unmodified. ONNX Runtime is MIT licensed.
Package licenses/ contains model, runtime and Rust dependency notices/licenses.
